        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Characters: Alma Wade\n- Games: F.E.A.R., SAS: Secure Tomorrow\n- Companies: Monolith Productions, Sierra Entertainment\n- Systems: Jupiter EX engine\n- Topics: survival horror, first-person shooter\n\nFacts:\n- Monolith Productions introduced Alma Wade in the 2005 video game F.E.A.R.\n- Alma Wade is a major antagonist and key figure in the F.E.A.R. series.\n- The mystery of Alma Wade is central to the F.E.A.R. series.\n- F.E.A.R. First Encounter Assault Recon is a survival horror first-person shooter video game developed by Monolith Productions and published by Sierra Entertainment.\n- SAS: Secure Tomorrow uses the Jupiter EX engine, which is similar or possibly identical to the engine used in F.E.A.R.",
